Is this quadrilateral convex or non-convex?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]
\draw (0,2.6)--(4.2,1.3);
\draw (4.2,1.3)--(0,0);
\draw (0,0)--(1.5,1.3);
\draw (1.5,1.3)--(0,2.6);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Is this quadrilateral convex or non-convex?

foundation.solution_text:
One vertex points back into the shape, so the interior angle there is bigger than $180^{\circ}$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]
\draw (0,2.6)--(4.2,1.3);
\draw (4.2,1.3)--(0,0);
\draw (0,0)--(1.5,1.3);
\draw (1.5,1.3)--(0,2.6);
\draw (1.122,0.973) arc[start angle=-139.086,end angle=139.086,radius=0.5];
\node at (2.45,1.3) {$>180^{\circ}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Non-convex

